 "words": 209,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "On the hill above the city the disciples gathered near",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lord, will you now restore the kingdom, will it be this year",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not for you to know the seasons that the Father's hand has set",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But he gave a mission and a promise they would not forget",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 1.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You will receive power when the Holy Spirit comes upon you",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And you will be my witnesses",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In Jerusalem, in all Judea and Samaria",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And to the ends of the earth",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When he had said this, as they watched, he was lifted up",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And a cloud took him from their sight",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lifting up his hands, he blessed them",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And was carried up into heaven",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You will receive power when the Holy Spirit comes upon you",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And you will be my witnesses",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In Jerusalem, in all Judea and Samaria",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And to the ends of the earth",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Men of Galilee",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Why do you stand here looking into the sky",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This same Jesus, who has been taken from you into heaven",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Will come back in the same way you have seen him go",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And they worshiped him and returned to Jerusalem with great joy",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And they were continually in the temple, praising God",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This same Jesus will come back",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To the ends of the earth",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  }
